OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested after fire at
OL,4,Aindustrial estate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of arson after a large fire
OL,8,Fdestroyed several businesses on an
OL,9,Findustrial estate.
OL,11,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service was called
OL,12,Fto a blaze at Locking Farm Industrial
OL,13,FEstate in Weston-super-Mare at 03:03
OL,14,FBST on Tuesday. The fire closed the
OL,15,FA371 for most of the day.
OL,17,FAvon and Somerset Police launched an
OL,18,Finvestigation and found the cause was
OL,19,Flikely deliberate. A 17-year-old boy
OL,20,Fwas arrested on suspicion of an arson
OL,21,Foffence and remains in police custody.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
